<title>HONG KONG: GZITIC owns 73 pct Hualing after offer.</title>
<headline>GZITIC owns 73 pct Hualing after offer.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whiteside Holdings Ltd holds 584.05 million shares or 73 percent of Hualing Holdings Ltd at close of a general offer on January 10, the companies said in a joint statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Whiteside is wholly-owned by Guangzhou International Trust and Investment Corp (GZITIC).</p>
<p>In November, GZITIC's unit was requird to make a general offer for Hualing shares at HK$0.80 per share after GZITIC raised its stake in Hualing to 37.49 percent on completion of a rights shares issue, from 17.1 percent.</p>
<p>Hualing shares were down HK$0.01 to HK$1.05 at midday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
